---
// Numbers from the hook text (Facebook, NSDI 2013): 17,000 -> 1,300 queries/s.
const W = 900, H = 230;
const X0 = 190, MAXW = 560, MAX = 17000;
const bw = (v: number) => (v / MAX) * MAXW;
---
<figure class="bep8h">
  <div class="bep8h-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two bars of peak database queries per second on stampede-prone keys. Without a lease: 17,000. With a lease that hands out one rebuild token per key every 10 seconds: 1,300.">
    <text x="40" y="40" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>peak database queries per second on stampede-prone keys</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đỉnh số query mỗi giây vào database ở các key hay bị stampede</tspan></text>

    <text x={X0 - 16} y="95" text-anchor="end" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>no lease</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không lease</tspan></text>
    <rect x={X0} y="70" width={bw(17000)} height="40" rx="6" class="bad" />
    <text x={X0 + bw(17000) + 12} y="96" class="h red">17,000</text>

    <text x={X0 - 16} y="165" text-anchor="end" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>with lease</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>có lease</tspan></text>
    <rect x={X0} y="140" width={bw(1300)} height="40" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x={X0 + bw(1300) + 12} y="166" class="h">1,300</text>
    <text x={X0 + bw(1300) + 90} y="166" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>one rebuild token per key every 10 s; the rest wait and retry the cache</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi key một token rebuild trong 10 s; số còn lại chờ rồi đọc lại cache</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The same hot keys, the same traffic. Letting one caller rebuild while the others wait cut the database load by more than ten times.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng các key nóng, cùng lượng traffic. Cho một caller rebuild còn những caller khác chờ đã giảm tải database hơn mười lần.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep8h { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep8h-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep8h svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 760px; height: auto; }
  .bep8h text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep8h .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep8h .h.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8h .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep8h .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep8h .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep8h .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep8h .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep8h .ln.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .bep8h .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8h .ah.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8h figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
